WEBVTT

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.921
Every sale is kept in <b>Tickets</b>

00:00:02.971 --> 00:00:09.001
Each one with the time, who rang it up, how it was paid and what was sold

00:00:09.073 --> 00:00:13.263
Search by customer, by cashier or by ticket code

00:00:13.337 --> 00:00:17.449
Open it to see it exactly as it was printed

00:00:17.521 --> 00:00:21.553
Send it to your customer on WhatsApp with their number

00:00:21.622 --> 00:00:26.858
Or save it as an image, or reprint it on the receipt printer
